writeFileSync(resolve(outputDir, 'README.md'), `# Domain Kitchen character review\n\nImport **domain-kitchen-chef-proof.glb** into Blender. The seven animation names are idle, walk, carry, cook, wash, eat and takeOrder. The four limb skins use the same joint transforms as the running game.\n\nThis is a local review copy, not a runtime replacement or licensed third-party package. Work tools are omitted because core glTF does not key visibility. Walking stays in place; eating expects a separate chair with a 0.47 m seat. Each loop uses a 0.20-second closure blend.\n\nThe JSON receipts record source hashes, exported bytes, static asset inspection and the explicit validation policy. They do not claim visual approval. No paid generation was used.\n`);
